# Wave T36 (Starfall kit): starfloor — Starfall City's registered
# street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix;
# the desire-path tiers key on it). STAR-SAND LANE: pale warm sand
# in the path family strewn with fine star sparkle — tiny pale
# flecks and sparse gold motes over quiet sand grain. A sparkle
# scatter on open sand is structurally unlike every shipped
# street: Lotus Cove's round-cobble mosaic, Lilac's bronze
# lattice grid, Fairhaven's running-bond quay slabs, Copperton's
# square quarry flags and Beacon's bolted decking.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T36-STARFALL-PLAN.md.)
